    or "Galaxy" card from your Deck to your hand, or send it to the GY. If a LIGHT
    monster(s) is Special Summoned to your field (except during the Damage Step):
    You can target 1 of those monsters; its Level becomes 4 or 8 until the end of
    this turn.'
